<title>CANADA: GM Canada sales fall 3.6 pct in November.</title>
<headline>GM Canada sales fall 3.6 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>OSHAWA, Ontario 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors of Canada Ltd, a wholly owned unit of General Motors Corp, said on Monday its sales for November were as follows:</p>
<p>		     PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	    -3.6		   27,935	   28,981</p>
<p>   Cars	     -7.2		   14,556	   15,686</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +0.6		   13,379	   13,295</p>
<p>   YEAR-TO-DATE  PCT CHANGE	    1996	     1995</p>
<p>   Total	    -2.5		  350,791	  359,890</p>
<p>   Cars	     -6.1		  202,070	  215,249</p>
<p>   Trucks	   +2.8		  148,721	  144,641</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
